[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   step_08: the clock channel -- osculating-to-original orbit discrepancy
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   vs direction to the TNO boundary axis.
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   TEP nuance missed by the directional-excess test (step_07): under TEP a
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   proper-time boundary does not primarily change WHICH direction comets
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   arrive from -- it changes the comet's CLOCK during passage.  The Warsaw
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   catalogue's "original" orbits are back-integrated under standard
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   dynamics; if a comet crossed a temporal boundary, that reconstruction is
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   biased.  The observable is therefore:
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   - the DISCREPANCY between the measured (osculating) orbit and the
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   back-integrated (original) orbit -- direction-selective if and only
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   if the discrepancy source sits on the boundary axis;
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   - direction-selective structure in the original ENERGY (1/a_orig);
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   - direction-selective need for non-gravitational (NG) solutions --
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   unexplained momentum exchange is the standard patch for exactly the
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   kind of anomaly a temporal gradient produces.
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   Data: J/A+A/567/A126 (Krolikowska 2014) tables a1, b, b4, c -- all real.
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   Nulls: permutation of directions (preserves aa/element distributions),
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   plus control axes (galactic pole, apex, anti-axis) -- the signature must
[2026-09-20 10:44:20 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 031]   be axis-specific, not generic.
